<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Phelps Dodge near-term cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Phelps Dodge near-term cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it cut Phelps Dodge Corp near-term rating to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Merrill said it kept the long-term rating as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
